	"data": "Cover Letter Christopher DiCarlo Savant\n\nJuly 20, 2020\nSavant \nHyannis, MA\nRe: Unity Software Developer\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the position of Unity Software Developer.\nI am very interested in this position. I believe I am a solid fit for this work, including experience with Unity, C#, Git, and shaders/lighting.\nI have been studying and developing programs with Unity and C# for the last couple of years and have a high degree of knowledge and interest in software development. I…",
